      "JAY: Hey, beautiful.\nGRACIE: Hey, liar. Sorry about missing the Bridal Shower. But at least I sent a gift.",
      "JAY: Honey, would you like to come home with us tonight?\nGRACIE: Oh, that is so nice... And so pathetic. I only moved out a year ago. As Gracie starts to get back in the car, a voice calls out.",
      "KATHY: It's been a very busy day for Miss Hart. We have to let her get her beauty rest.\nGRACIE: See you in three weeks when the Valium wears off.",
      "KATHY: I haven't been here since we moved the pageant to San Antonio. It's a shame what happened to this city. It forgot who it was.\nGRACIE: That happens to me a lot.\nKATHY: You're very clever. That's why you did well in there. I was impressed.\nGRACIE: No, you saved m e .",
      "MISS OHIO: You want some?\nGRACIE: •fi ^ Gee, is it that obvious? Actually, f I find a warm bath with Epsom Salt really helps.\nGRACIE: You could blind yourself!\nMISS OHIO: It reduces swelling around the eyes. Removes unsightly bags. Didn't you know that?"
